 832:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** /**
 833:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Enables the Clock Security System.
